# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers (shebang + `sh`/`bash`) -- a CRLF
# line ending breaks the shebang (`/bin/sh\r`: no such file or directory) on
# any checkout where core.autocrlf converts LF to CRLF (default on Windows).
# This forces LF regardless of the checking-out machine's autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
